Here's the enhanced code with improved scaling/zooming, fractal transformations, dynamic subdivision, vibrant strokes, and exposed control parameters:

```html
<!-- Control Parameters -->
<script>
const CONFIG = {
  // Transformation
  scale: 0.35,
  zoom: 500,
  offsetX: 0.5,
  offsetY: 0.5,

  // Rotation Speeds
  angleXSpeed: 0.001,
  angleYSpeed: 0.0013,
  angleZSpeed: 0.0007,

  // Shape Complexity
  subdivisionLevel: 3,

  // Fractal Displacement
  displacement: {
    frequency: 5,
    amplitude: 0.1,
    octaves: 3
  },

